0..78 Comment "// The tasks subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by every"
79..155 Comment "// source that reads them (`import \"./task-base.gandr\" ;`): a task forked as"
156..229 Comment "// its parent\'s peer hands back what it found over its end. A fork is the"
230..306 Comment "// parallel product of two strategies and an operation a move of one of them"
307..386 Comment "// (Melliès and Stefanesco, doi:10.1145/3373718.3394762); the parent joins its"
387..465 Comment "// task by reading the end to its close, so no task outlives its parent, as no"
466..519 Comment "// task outlives the nursery that started it in Trio."
521..597 Comment "/// A task: the protocol its end carries back to the parent, and the path it"
598..608 Comment "/// reads."
